{'symbol': 'PTC', 'date': '2021-09-23 09:00:00', 'title': 'PTC PROVIDES "LEADING AR PLATFORM FOR CONNECTED WORKERS IN THE MARKET TODAY," ACCORDING TO TEKNOWLOGY GROUP', 'text': 'BOSTON, SEPT. 23, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- PTC\xa0(NASDAQ: PTC) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT, FOR THE THIRD YEAR IN A ROW, ITS VUFORIA® ENTERPRISE AUGMENTED REALITY SUITE (AR) HAS BEEN NAMED A "BEST IN CLASS" TECHNOLOGY IN TEKNOWLOGY GROUP\'S LATEST PAC RADAR VENDOR ANALYSIS.'}